title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">11\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000110000</span>110<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/Special_event_items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">Special event items</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Special_event_history#New_Theater_Event_(September_2007)\" title=\"Special event history\">New Theater Event</a> for wrong answer\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lousy_Chain_Docent%3F.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Lousy_Chain_Docent%3F.png/420px-Lousy_Chain_Docent%3F.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"271\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lousy_Chain_Docent%3F.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>You participated in a Live Event, but all you got was this lousy chain docent.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lousy_Chain_Docent%3F_Defender_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lousy_Chain_Docent%3F_Defender_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"282\" height=\"252\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Has a unique look.</li>\n<li>Other than 1 more hardness and 10 more durability, this is just a basic <a href=\"/page/Docent\" title=\"Docent\">docent</a>.</li>\n<li>This is an extremely rare item that was distributed in 2008-2009 during live events. Only members of the DDO Community Team have the ability to distribute this item.</li>\n<li>This item also has a <a href=\"/page/Item:Lousy_Chainshirt\" title=\"Item:Lousy Chainshirt\">chainshirt version</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817054240\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCo